sent solution for the GDPR and ePrivacy, Digital Markets Act (DMA), CCPA/CPRA and more.\nStart trial\n14-day free trial\nCancel any time Scan website\nCheck if your website is privacy compliant\n14-day free trial\nCancel any time\nCheck if your website is privacy compliant\nYour website address\nStart scan\nThe most used solution for compliant use of cookies and online tracking\n2.4M\nwebsites and apps\n8.8B\nmonthly user consents\n47+\nlanguages\n600,000+\ncustomers\nStart your interactive demo\nTake this demo tour to explore how Cookiebot CMP can help you comply with regulations, automate consent signaling, and optimize consent rates for better marketing results. Explore Demo\nIs your website privacy compliant?\nWith our scanner, you can easily check what cookies and tracking technologies collect user data on your website.\nYour website address\nScan now\nWhat is a Consent Management Platform?\nA Consent Management Platform (CMP) enables businesses to comply with data privacy laws like the GDPR, CCPA and LGPD. It also enables users’ full control over how their data is collected and used, building trust and balancing data privacy with data-driven business.\nCookiebot Consent Management Platform (CMP) can help automate the entire technical and legal process of cookie consent on your website. We offer a scalable and highly customizable solution that enables companies to add a customized cookie banner to collect user consent in a compliant way.\nlearn more\nAchieve easy and automated data privacy compliance with Cookiebot CMP\nEasy maintenance on multiple domains\nAchieve data privacy compliance with a scalable solution that is straightforward to implement and maintain, easy to use and fully automated.\nHighly customizable for trustworthy user experience\nImprove your data privacy strategy and protect your advertising revenue with a solution that is fully customizable for your business needs.\nReliable technology and expertise\nOptimize your website performance and stay ahead of technology and regulatory changes with the latest state of the art technology and legal expertise.\nCookiebot consent solution is Google-certified for Consent Mode\nCookiebot™ is a Google-certified Consent Management Platform (CMP), fully supporting Transparency and Consent Framework (TCF) and Google Consent Mode v2. Starting 2024, Google has mandated the use of Consent Mode for ads personalization, remarketing and analytics in the EU/EEA and Switzerland.\nEnable Consent Mode with Cookiebot cookie compliance solution to benefit from conversion and analytics modeling, and avoid losing marketing data due to rejected consent banners.\nGoogle Ads\nGoogle Analytics\nGDPR\nePrivacy\nTry Cookiebot™ today!\nExperience how easy it can be to make your site data privacy compliant.\nStart free trial\nOur latest articles on all things privacy\nPersonally Identifiable Information: Examples and Why PII Isn't the Same as Personal Data\nPII is a term with no single definition in the U.S. Broadly, it refers to any information that can identify an individual either directly or indirectly. This guide will list the most common examples of...\nIntroducing the Cookiebot Configuration Health Checker: Find Setup Gaps Before They Become Problems\nCookiebot™ has introduced a self-service Configuration Health Checker, available in the Cookiebot Admin. Now in Beta, it scans your live CMP setup against core...\nIAB TCF Explained For Your Website In 2026\nIAB TCF v2.4 has an implementation deadline of October 23, 2026 for websites. This guide shows what IAB TCF is, what’s new in the upcoming version compared to previous ones, and what you as a website operator can do today to introduce IAB TCF v2.4 and serve...\nFrequently asked questions\nWho is Cookiebot by Usercentrics?\nCookiebot by Usercentrics provides a plug-and-play compliance solution built around unrivaled scanning technology. It detects and controls all cookies and trackers in use on websites and automatically manages end-user consents.\nOur solution fits any type of website. Organizations can automate all data privacy requirements online while providing easy and fast consent management for users.\nCookiebot Consent Management Platform (CMP) is a self-serve cloud-based service provided by Usercentrics. It enables automated compliance with global data privacy laws like the EU’s GDPR, California’s CCPA/CPRA, Brazil’s LGPD and many others.\nRead more information here.\nWhat does a Consent Management Platform (CMP) do on websites?\nA consent management platform is a technology that can be implemented on websites and other applications to collect and process personal data from website users and customers. It enables companies to collect and store legally valid consent and helps the end user protect and maintain control over their personal data.\nWhat is personal data?\nPersonal data or personal information is information that can be used to identify a person, directly or indirectly, alone or in combination with other pieces of data.\nDifferent data privacy regulations have their own specific definitions of personal data, and there can be additional subcategories that require special handling, like sensitive personal data.\nWhat happens if end users don’t give their consent?\nIf end users decide not to give their consent on a website for processing their personal data, the cookies and trackers that collect data will be blocked. No personal data will be collected, processed or shared with third-party providers.\nEnd users’ consent preferences are saved in their web browser and retrieved on future visits to the website.\nStay informed\nJoin our growing community of data privacy enthusiasts now. Subscribe to the Cookiebot™ newsletter and get all the latest updates right in your inbox.\nNewsletter\nEnter your email\nSubscribe\nBy clicking on “Subscribe” I confirm that I want to subscribe to the Cookiebot™ newsletter. I can easily cancel my Cookiebot™ newsletter subscription and revoke consent to use my data by clicking the unsubscribe link or I can write to [email protected] to make the request. Privacy policy.\nDownload the CMP integration for your preferred CMS\nUsercentrics Cookiebot plugin for WordPress\nStay privacy compliant with the Usercentrics Cookiebot plugin for WordPress, seamlessly integrated with WordPress to manage user consent.\nDownload plugin\nUsercentrics for Wix\nDownload the Usercentrics for Wix app from the Wix App Market to easily manage user consent, increase trust, and maintain privacy compliance.\nDownload app\nSubscribe to our newsletter\nGet our monthly newsletter with insightful articles, industry news, and event invites.\nSubscribe\nEnter your email\nSubscribe\nBy clicking on “Subscribe” I confirm that I want to subscribe to the Usercentrics newsletter. I agree that my data may be used for any information related to the products and services offered by Cookiebot™. I can easily revoke this any time by clicking the unsubscribe link or by emailing Cookiebot™ at [email protected]. See Privacy Policy\nProducts\nCookiebot™ Consent Solution Audience Survey Usercentrics for Wix Usercentrics Cookiebot plugin for WordPress Cookiebot CMP for Shopify Cookie checker Usercentrics products Pricing\nRegulations\nDMA (EU) GDPR (EU) CCPA (California) VCDPA (Virginia) LGPD (Brazil) TCF v2.4 (IAB) Google Consent Mode (EU) Microsoft UET Consent Mode View all regulations\nPartners\nBecome an affiliate Affiliate Login Become a partner Find a partner\nResources\nBlog Customer stories Customer directory Digital Markets Act Hub Google Consent Mode Hub Google Consent Mode V2 certification Google Consent Audit Fixes Cookie Banner Cost Calculator\nCompany\nAbout us Careers Support Developer documentation\n©2026 Cookiebot. All rights reserved.\nCookiebot is a trademark of Usercentrics A/S. Usercentrics A/S is registered in Denmark. Company reg. no.: 34624607.\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal InformationData Subject RequestsManage Your Preferences\nPrivac